SPEC §3.1, API.md §2.1, O3 (DECISIONS 332): an override places a required root where no directory is, over project.local.canon, which placed it on an existing one.
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
  roots {
    resource: "../Resource"
  }
}
-- project.local.canon --
project acme {
  roots {
    resource: "../Resource2"
  }
}
-- ../Resource2/a.h --
-- roots --
resource=/nowhere/Resource
-- findings.txt --
error[E1013]
  root "resource" ("/nowhere/Resource", from --root or Options.Roots) is not a directory on this machine: give an existing directory, or list the root in optional_roots in project.canon

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
